  "ruleText": "Env-A 1707.01 Form ARD-5, Information Required For Permits For A Fuel Loading Facility. In addition to Form ARD-1, an applicant for a permit for a fuel loading facility shall complete and submit Form ARD-5, “Information Required for Permits for a Fuel Loading Facility” dated September 9, 2019.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95 (from Env-A 103.01); ss by #7886, eff 5-3-03; ss by #9707, INTERIM, eff 5-3-11, EXPIRES: 10-31-11; ss by #10001, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12965, eff 1-6-20",
